{"id":"kuda","lemma":"куда","pos":"adv","rank":137,"glosses":["where?","why?","much (more), a lot (more)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/0/08/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D0%BA%D1%83%D0%B4%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Куда бы вы поехали?","en":"Where would you go?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1274860","words":[null,{"g":"would"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},{"g":"Let's go!"}]},{"text":"Ты куда ходил?","en":"Where did you go?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/679176","words":[{"g":"you"},null,{"g":"to go, to walk","l":"ходить"}]},{"text":"Куда мы можем пойти?","en":"Where can we go?","words":[null,{"g":"we"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Я знаю, куда идти.","en":"I know where to go.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"to go"}]},{"text":"Скажи мне, куда идти.","en":"Tell me where to go.","words":[{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,{"g":"to go"}]}]}